{"3802770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLOODVILLE", "steam_appid": 3802770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/e5de3edb17fa1dcf4cdd3a2c6a9b3524.poster.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/e5de3edb17fa1dcf4cdd3a2c6a9b3524.webm?t=1784043178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/6abe5e335a4ba30a89723332a58dab08.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cane</i></strong><i>, once a feared hitman, has no choice but to return to killing alongside his old crew: <strong>Jim</strong> and <strong>Adam</strong>. But as the days pass, strange visions and nightmares begin to tear at his sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/cdb4035f1e050ea3398a120858f2dc90.poster.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/cdb4035f1e050ea3398a120858f2dc90.webm?t=1784043178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODVILLE</strong> is a first-person shooter with a sharp edge: fast gunplay, bone-crunching melee, and a story that shifts from hired hits to psychological torment. Over six nights, you’ll unlock weapons, fight through diverse locations, and slowly uncover the reason nothing feels real anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/f4bcda982f6ed60fcd96c88544bcbaed.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Combat</strong> - A blend of <strong>DOOM</strong>’s raw shooter pace and <strong>Hotline Miami</strong>’s precision brutality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting Atmosphere</strong> - Experience tense dream fragments, moody environments and buried memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> - Compete for the most kills, least time and biggest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Soundtrack</strong> - Buy <strong>BLOODVILLE</strong> and get the <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> in digital format.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/ed9671b4723c9a17b4754bc50e240ed7.poster.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=165 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/ed9671b4723c9a17b4754bc50e240ed7.webm?t=1784043178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/e5de3edb17fa1dcf4cdd3a2c6a9b3524.poster.avif?t=1784043178\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802770/extras/e5de3edb17fa1dcf4cdd3a2c6a9b3524.webm?t=1784043178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><